{"id":15950,"author":"Cyclops","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWelcome to the details/info page on Match #32 [Rto3]\u0026nbsp;(Skyhigh/#Bow/Bowfighters).\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMatch will be held on August 19th, 3:00pm Eastern Standard Time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eWhitelist will be turned off 30 minutes prior to start.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eSkyhigh:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eAfter 45 minutes, any player below y=101 will begin to take half a heart of damage every 30 seconds.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e#Bow:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eAll kinds of melee, including sword, punch, or axe, is disabled. Even iPVP is disabled. The only way to damage a player is with a bow. You are able to damage mobs with sword/melee, however.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eBowfighters:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eEveryone is given 1 arrow,2 string and an Infinity book. The highest tier of melee weapon you can get is wood sword/stone axe.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eServer Info:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr s